{"about_the_game":"Chupa Chupa VR is a classic stealth licking game that has you licking recorders, drinks, and other things in a familiar classroom, all while trying not to get caught by the girls.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Punishment (Or Perhaps a Reward)</h2>If a girl catches you licking things, the game will end, and a very tough punishment will await you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336160/extras/df02f00287d4802f2bf0a1a275aa72dc.avif?t=1726577872\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6A Safe and Reliable Time Skip Cell Phone</h2>Even if you end up in the worst (or best) outcome after getting caught by a girl, you can start over from the beginning as many times as you like with the attached cell phone, so you can enjoy yourself until you are satisfied.<br>Also, rest assured that your high scores and licking experiences will be carried over between each game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336160/extras/bf70197d55724dbc2c9c722eaa6ce492.avif?t=1726577872\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Ranking Feature</h2>There is also a competitive ranking feature that tracks how many things you licked, and how quickly and accurately you licked them without getting caught by a girl, so you can compete with lickers across the world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336160/extras/501442b10aca826379c063ebb71dcd5d.avif?t=1726577872\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Dream Items</h2>In addition to things that lickers consider must-lick items such as recorders, drinks, bathing suits, and toothbrushes, there are also dream items like a watch that stops time and medicine that makes you invisible.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336160/extras/ffc3ad92a72b56b5a9b01bffbc919504.avif?t=1726577872\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Nurse's Office</h2>The nurse's office allows you to change the language and volume settings, and if you purchase the wardrobe DLC, you can also enjoy the girls in many different outfits.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336160/extras/32ff6e3a4f9ca84e9d8bbb8002e89488.avif?t=1726577872\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Character change</h2>If you purchase the following DLC, you will be able to change your character. (Game content will not change.)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1336160/extras/f23ad1dc513a91cc8188cff999d41f43.avif?t=1726577872\" width=616 height=346 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"cf2ff8164e50bc3d7e2775e73a62ec896c338569.jpg","localized_name":"The recorder flute of the beginning","name":"The recorder flute of the beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1336160/cf2ff8164e50bc3d7e2775e73a62ec896c338569.jpg"},{"icon":"a3d763bdb714765db255be3dc0472234ff143ef2.jpg","localized_name":"The pain of the beginning","name":"The pain of the beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1336160/a3d763bdb714765db255be3dc0472234ff143ef2.jpg"},{"icon":"dca343ffddca423516d1e8bcf5e93842d8eba0d9.jpg","localized_name":"The theft of the beginning","name":"The theft of the beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1336160/dca343ffddca423516d1e8bcf5e93842d8eba0d9.jpg"},{"icon":"ead115587234a07d1b88df5beaa0710193816c1e.jpg","localized_name":"The despair of the beginning","name":"The despair of the beginnin